# NegoAsia — Netlify redirects
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The four article URLs from the WordPress site are NOT redirected: they are
# served at the exact same paths by the new site, so their SEO is preserved
# with zero loss. Only the legacy WordPress archive/taxonomy URLs are mapped.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Legacy WordPress archives and taxonomies -> the new Insights index
/news/                 /blog/     301
/news                  /blog/     301
/uncategorized/        /blog/     301
/uncategorized         /blog/     301
/category/             /blog/     301
/category              /blog/     301
/negotiation/          /blog/     301
/negotiation           /blog/     301

# WordPress plumbing that may still be linked or crawled
/wp-admin/*            /          301
/wp-login.php          /          301
/feed/                 /blog/     301
/comments/feed/        /blog/     301
/?feed=*               /blog/     301

# Safety net for the .html paths used during the build phase
/about.html            /about/     301
/services.html         /services/  301
/contact.html          /contact/   301
/blog.html             /blog/      301
/terms.html            /terms/     301
/privacy.html          /privacy/   301
/thanks.html           /thanks/    301
